  "id": 203987334884186,
  "uuid": "ba01db30-ec8a-4f83-8e6f-dcdaef32faad",
  "is_folder": false,
  "content": {
    "_uid": "d8947534-e84d-0121-bcda-fd154fd4e095",
    "body": [
      {
        "_uid": "d9ff72c3-5b39-201f-348c-bbe8014a754e",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "\"My decision to pursue nursing solidified during a visit to the hospital to see my sister's child,\" Shirleen recalls. \"I encountered a nurse who was rude when I asked for directions to the ward. That experience made me realize I wanted to be a different kind of nurse, one who spreads kindness and smiles to patients, offering care with compassion to anyone in need.\"",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Shirleen's passion for nursing extends beyond providing medical assistance. She believes in the power of human connection and the positive impact that a compassionate caregiver can have on a patient's recovery. \"Through my nursing career, I hope to gain the skills to care for people at their most vulnerable times,\" she says. \"There's a unique warmth in seeing someone recover from illness and knowing you played a role in their healing.\"",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Choosing Aga Khan University was a natural choice for Shirleen, who was drawn to the institution's reputation for excellence in education and its supportive community. \"A friend introduced me to the institution, and I've come to appreciate its quality facilities, supportive faculty, and diverse student body,\" she explains. \"I feel like I'm in the right place to learn and develop the values that will shape my career.\"",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "As Shirleen begins her nursing journey, she is excited to explore the opportunities that AKU offers, both academically and socially. \"I'm looking forward to making new friends and immersing myself in the school's diverse culture,\" she says. \"I can't wait to join clubs and participate in activities that balance my academic life with recreation.\"",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "While balancing her social life and studies may be a challenge, Shirleen is confident in her ability to overcome it. \"I'm ready to take on whatever comes my way,\" she says. \"With hard work, dedication, and a passion for helping others, I believe I can achieve my goals and make a positive impact on the world.\"",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
