    "show_share": true,
    "description": "From childhood dreams of playing with medical toy sets to witnessing firsthand the compassionate care provided by her aunts, Shirleen Muthoni has always been drawn to the nursing profession. Now, as a first-year nursing student at AKU, she is eager to embark on a journey that will allow her to make a difference in the lives of others.",
